      *******************************************************************
      * APPLICATION: Shipping                                           *
      * FILE NAME:   HYLSSCC8                                           *
      * DESCRIPTION: Serial Shipping Container Code Content File and    *
      *              Serial Shipping Container Code Content Work File   *
      *                keyed by SRL#, ORD#, ORL#, BLN#, LOT#            *
      * WRITTEN BY:  William Earl (MCA)                                 *
      * DATE:        December 2010                                      *
      *                                                                 *
      *    Date     By   Description                                    *
      * ----------  ---  ---------------------------------------------  *
      * XX/XX/XXXX  XXX  XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX  *
      *******************************************************************
     A          R HYRSSCC                   PFILE(HYPSSCC)
      *
     A          K SCSRL#
     A          K SCORD#
     A          K SCORL#
     A          K SCBLN#
     A          K SCLOT#
      *
     A          R HYRSCWK                   PFILE(HYPSCWK)
      *
     A          K S1SRL#
     A          K S1ORD#
     A          K S1ORL#
     A          K S1BLN#
     A          K S1LOT#
      *
     A          S S1SRL#                    COMP(NE 0)
